\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces PBR-to-cel transition sequence. The two coloured boxes (gold and blue) in the Cornell Box are the stylization targets. At low $t$ the scene is photorealistic with GI; at high $t$ the boxes exhibit hard cel-shading boundaries while retaining colour bleeding from the walls.}}{6}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:transition}{{3}{6}{PBR-to-cel transition sequence. The two coloured boxes (gold and blue) in the Cornell Box are the stylization targets. At low $t$ the scene is photorealistic with GI; at high $t$ the boxes exhibit hard cel-shading boundaries while retaining colour bleeding from the walls}{figure.caption.10}{}}
