\newlabel{fig:light_sweep}{{4}{6}{Six frames from the light-sweep animation across the Sculpture Garden. Objects display cel-shading (left pedestal/sphere), tie-dye (column/top orb), and ACP (right pedestals/sphere). Shadows rotate and each style function reacts distinctly to the changing illumination}{figure.caption.11}{}}
